  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Scannable
  displayName: Dekarios Mermaid
  scientificName: Piscis Humano
  description: A singular beast, largely piscine in its lower aspect, yet possessed
    of a bulbous, forward-gazing eye and a body patterned in gold and umber, like
    an illuminated manuscript penned by someone with an unsettled imagination. The
    spines along its back suggest a creature that has been told, on more than one
    occasion, to mind itself. One obliges willingly.
  journalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5eb892e1b6988bf4593f3f90e9679a18, type: 3}
